## Why This Is Asked
Tests automated incident response capabilities across multi-account, multi-region AWS environments with emphasis on containment automation and forensics preservation.

## Key Concepts
- GuardDuty/Security Hub automation and cross-account integration
- Cross-region IAM credential rotation workflows
- SSM-based quarantine and Run Command execution
- EBS snapshots, CloudTrail, and VPC flow logs preservation
- S3 with KMS encryption, Object Lock, and immutable vault storage
- Rollback procedures, runbooks, and testing frameworks

